Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit

I have used the following for several years without problem.

find . -print|cpio -H crc -ov|compress|dd of=/dev/tapedrivename

to extract:

dd if=/dev/tapedrivename|uncompress|cpio -iv

you can add other options to cpio -i has required.


Bill Edmonson

